Pulse for Omarchy
Copyright 2026 fatwang2

This plugin is a port of the market-data layer from Pulse for macOS
(https://github.com/fatwang2/Pulse), which is MIT licensed and by the same
author. Its symbol identity, market sessions, provider routing and quote
derivation follow that implementation; the QML surface is written for Omarchy.

Market data is fetched from public endpoints operated by third parties. Those
services are not affiliated with this plugin and set their own terms, coverage
and delays.
